@{ViewData["Title"]="Awareness hub";}<section class="intro"><div><small>COMMUNITY PREVENTION</small><h2>Safer water starts with awareness.</h2><p>Simple practices that support safer water handling and sanitation.</p></div></section><div class="disease-grid"><article class="panel"><h3>Safe drinking water</h3><ul><li>Use a trusted treated-water source.</li><li>Follow official boil-water advisories.</li><li>Store water in clean, covered containers.</li><li>Use approved treatment methods where advised.</li></ul></article><article class="panel"><h3>Everyday hygiene</h3><ul><li>Wash hands with soap at key moments.</li><li>Keep food preparation surfaces clean.</li><li>Use safe sanitation and waste disposal.</li><li>Seek medical care for severe dehydration.</li></ul></article></div><section class="panel"><h3>Trusted resource</h3><a class="more" href="https://www.who.int/health-topics/drinking-water" target="_blank">World Health Organization · Drinking-water ↗</a></section>